# Summary

The charter states that "Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter." [[cite:obs-d781a23c47bb2f2178b6094c1702cdf65edb3004 "Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter."]]

The annex specifies: "Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January." [[cite:obs-c518ebd51e30bc9136add526c87df6fc74a412c2 "Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January."]]
